import{_ as i,o as n,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 451 | Dragon Ball · Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou: The Divide Between Personal Combat Power and Myriad-Ranks Symbiosis","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 451 | Dragon Ball · Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou: The Divide Between Personal Combat Power and Myriad-Ranks Symbiosis","no":451,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Goku","Heng Yuan Zhou","Myriad-Ranks Symbiosis","Network Civilization","Divide"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","05-Myriad-Ranks Co-Progression Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0451_模块2-龙珠-悟空vs衡元宙-个人战力与万族共生的分野.md","filePath":"en/0451_模块2-龙珠-悟空vs衡元宙-个人战力与万族共生的分野.md"}'),a={name:"en/0451_模块2-龙珠-悟空vs衡元宙-个人战力与万族共生的分野.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,c){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-451-dragon-ball-·-goku-vs-heng-yuan-zhou-the-divide-between-personal-combat-power-and-myriad-ranks-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">Entry 451 | Dragon Ball · Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou: The Divide Between Personal Combat Power and Myriad-Ranks Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-451-dragon-ball-·-goku-vs-heng-yuan-zhou-the-divide-between-personal-combat-power-and-myriad-ranks-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 451 | Dragon Ball · Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou: The Divide Between Personal Combat Power and Myriad-Ranks Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 20 · Cross-Protagonist Comparison 7 · Ultimate Contrast) | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 04, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-protecting-the-world-no-longer-needs-a-superman" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when &quot;protecting the world&quot; no longer needs a superman <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-protecting-the-world-no-longer-needs-a-superman" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when &quot;protecting the world&quot; no longer needs a superman&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe) is this series&#39;s ultimate contrast: Goku represents &quot;personal combat power carries the world&quot; ultimate form; Heng Yuan Zhou represents &quot;Myriad Ranks symbiotically co-build the world&quot; network civilization. The two are not good-evil distinction, but structural distinction — in Goku&#39;s world, Earth protected by one Saiyan; in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s world, civilization sustained by Anchor Council, Symbiotic Court, Alaya Network, Myriad-Ranks republican co-build. This entry takes the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> as core, making this divide clear.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Goku&#39;s waste</strong>: Zeno-tier aptitude for personal combat; civilization zero institutional spillover</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;anti-waste&quot;</strong>: any individual reaching Plane-Transcendent threshold must pass &quot;strength 40 / mind 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15&quot; four-dimensional exam; contribution and responsibility = 35% — strong ones&#39; energy must feed back to civilization</li><li><strong>Divide</strong>: Goku&#39;s energy is &quot;I use&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy is &quot;Myriad Ranks use&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Goku&#39;s world</strong>: strong one absent = collapse; disasters relied on wish rollback</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s world</strong>: Anchor Council + Symbiotic Executive Committee + Symbiotic Court + Anchor Inspection Committee separation of powers; any individual absent does not affect operation — order written into institutions, not tied to one person</li><li><strong>Divide</strong>: Goku&#39;s civilization is &quot;person present and policy rises, person gone and policy dies&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilization is &quot;law precedes, never retcons&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Goku&#39;s predation</strong>: innocent type — enemies as EXP packs; training resources monopolized</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;anti-predation&quot;</strong>: anti-predation axiom — develop increment, do not consume stock, do not take killing-predation as evolution path; Great Dao fully public across all tiers; no private hoard, no monopoly</li><li><strong>Divide</strong>: Goku&#39;s growth built on Myriad Ranks&#39; blood price; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s growth built on Myriad Ranks&#39; co-build</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Goku</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Civilization form</td><td>Gift-style-leaning-oligarchic</td><td>Network civilization</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</td><td>High</td><td>Extremely low</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge openness</td><td>Ki theory master-apprentice private transmission</td><td>300 Origin cultivation systems fully open</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Ranks coverage</td><td>Earth protected by Goku</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage</td></tr><tr><td>Causality handling</td><td>Dragon Ball wish rollback</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: observe first then limited interference</td></tr><tr><td>Law state</td><td>Law added with plot</td><td>Law precedes, never retcons</td></tr><tr><td>Strong one&#39;s responsibility</td><td>Win and it&#39;s done</td><td>Four-dimensional exam: strength 40 / mind 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates two cosmoses — Dragon Ball cosmos and Heng Yuan Zhou cosmos</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Goku institutionalizes his energy,&quot; &quot;Heng Yuan Zhou introduces personal-combat-power orientation&quot; two reverse controls</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count civilization survival years, Myriad-Ranks self-organization rate, combat-power inflation rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Personal Combat Power vs. Myriad-Ranks Symbiosis Ultimate Comparison Report</em>, quantifying the two civilization forms&#39; evolutionary differences on millennial scale</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Dragon Ball self-consistency: low</strong> (number inflation, multi-line retcon)</li><li><strong>Heng Yuan Zhou self-consistency: 9.5/10</strong> (law precedes, expansion via appendix, never retcons)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: Goku = high, Heng Yuan Zhou = extremely low</li><li><strong>Essence of divide</strong>: in Goku&#39;s world, Myriad Ranks are &quot;protected objects&quot;; in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s world, Myriad Ranks are &quot;co-build subjects&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Goku&#39;s energy for fighting; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy for Myriad-Ranks co-build</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Goku stands on Myriad Ranks&#39; suffering; Heng Yuan Zhou develops increment, does not consume stock</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least benefited humans; Heng Yuan Zhou Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Goku world&#39;s Myriad Ranks are backdrop; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad Ranks are co-build subjects</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Goku world locked by God-of-Destruction—Zeno pyramid; Heng Yuan Zhou can infinitely expand without collapse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku and Heng Yuan Zhou are not a &quot;who is stronger&quot; comparison, but a &quot;how should civilization be built&quot; comparison. Goku proved one thing in forty years: one person can be strong enough to sit at Zeno&#39;s table, but he cannot make civilization no longer need him. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: let Myriad Ranks stand up themselves, not because Goku is not strong enough, but because standing-up Myriad Ranks walk farther than protected Myriad Ranks. This is personal combat power and Myriad-Ranks symbiosis&#39;s ultimate divide.</p><p>One more layer: in Goku&#39;s world, &quot;protection&quot; and &quot;taming&quot; are separated by only a thin line — if Myriad Ranks never need to stand up themselves, what distinguishes them from penned livestock? Heng Yuan Zhou does not forbid strong ones from protecting Myriad Ranks, but requires strong ones while protecting to &quot;teach Myriad Ranks to protect themselves.&quot; Goku fought for forty years; Earthlings still cannot cultivate themselves, cannot early-warn themselves, cannot legislate themselves — this is &quot;protection&quot; turned into &quot;taming.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Anchor Symbiosis requires strong ones to be &quot;scaffolding,&quot; not &quot;cages&quot;: help Myriad Ranks stand up, then withdraw oneself.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · Goku vs. Heng Yuan Zhou · the divide between personal combat power and Myriad-Ranks symbiosis described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./450_模块2-龙珠-悟空vs纪宁-龙珠与莽荒的穿越者对比.html">Entry 450 · Goku vs. Ji Ning</a> · <a href="./452_模块2-龙珠-锚点共生替代方案-战力体系的文明化改造.html">Entry 452 · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
